   "id": 6,
   "options": {
    "content": "### Sensor #3: Solar Irradiance\n\n**Honde RD-PSR-01** (RS485 Modbus RTU, slave 3, FC03, register 0, 1 x UInt16, 1:1 W/m²) is **integrated** as of 2026-10-20 after field verification.\n\n- Acquisition: RutOS `modbus_client` polls it every 20 s into `/var/run/modbus_client/modbus.db`\n- Transport: direct HTTPS telemetry (`/api/telemetry/ingest`) is the primary path\n- History: Zabbix trapper item `rut.solar.radiation`, unit W/m²\n- No synthetic or interpolated values are ever written\n",
    "mode": "markdown"
   },
   "title": "Operational Governance",
   "type": "text"
  },
